  {
    "title": "Create owned pages",
    "explanation": "createPage is this implementation’s only page-construction path. The private constructor prevents calls from outside the enclosing Document class. Draft creates intro and appendix; Archive creates its own page. saved contains aliases to Draft’s actual pages, not additional composite owners.",
